name: sim.getProperty
description: Convenience functon to fetch a property
luaSynopsis: any propertyState = sim.getProperty(int target, string propertyName, dict options = {})
pythonSynopsis: any propertyState = sim.getProperty(int target, string propertyName, map options = {})
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. propertyName: property name
3. options: an optional map. Set options.noError to true for silent errors
outputs:
1. propertyState: property value
